### Comparación en un problema real

Comparamos un árbol, *bagging*, un bosque aleatorio, AdaBoost y *gradient boosting* en el conjunto *breast cancer* (569 tumores, 30 variables) con validación cruzada estratificada repetida.

::: {#cell-ens-comparacion .cell execution_count=4}
``` {.python .cell-code}
from sklearn.datasets import load_breast_cancer
from sklearn.ensemble import BaggingClassifier, RandomForestClassifier, GradientBoostingClassifier
from sklearn.model_selection import RepeatedStratifiedKFold, cross_validate, train_test_split

X, y = load_breast_cancer(return_X_y=True, as_frame=True)
cv = RepeatedStratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, n_repeats=3, random_state=0)
modelos = {
    "Árbol (sin poda)": DecisionTreeClassifier(random_state=0),
    "Bagging (300 árboles)": BaggingClassifier(DecisionTreeClassifier(), n_estimators=300, random_state=0, n_jobs=-1),
    "Bosque aleatorio (300)": RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=300, random_state=0, n_jobs=-1),
    "AdaBoost (300 tocones)": AdaBoostClassifier(DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=1), n_estimators=300, random_state=0),
    "Gradient boosting": GradientBoostingClassifier(random_state=0),
}
filas = []
for nombre, m in modelos.items():
    r = cross_validate(m, X, y, cv=cv, scoring=["accuracy", "roc_auc"])
    filas.append({"modelo": nombre, "exactitud": r["test_accuracy"].mean(), "desv.": r["test_accuracy"].std(),
                  "AUC": r["test_roc_auc"].mean()})
pd.DataFrame(filas).set_index("modelo").round(3)
```

